[{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n*usr_41.txt*    For Vim バージョン 8.2.  Last change: 2021 Jun 07\n \n                     VIM USER MANUAL - by Bram Moolenaar\n \n                              Vim script 書法\n \n \nVim script 言語は vimrc ファイルや構文ファイルなど、さまざまな目的に使われま\nす。この章では Vim script の書き方を説明します。説明することがたくさんあるので\n大きな章になってます。\n \n|41.1|  はじめに\n|41.2|  変数\n|41.3|  式\n|41.4|  条件式\n|41.5|  式を実行する\n|41.6|  関数を使う\n|41.7|  関数を定義する\n|41.8|  リストと辞書\n|41.9|  例外\n|41.10| 注意事項\n|41.11| プラグインを書く\n|41.12| ファイルタイププラグインを書く\n|41.13| コンパイラプラグインを書く\n|41.14| プラグインを書く (高速ロード版)\n|41.15| ライブラリスクリプトを書く\n|41.16| Vim script を配布する\n \n次章: |usr_42.txt|  新しいメニューを追加する\n前章: |usr_40.txt|  新しいコマンドを作る\n目次: |usr_toc.txt|\n```","ts":"1637304212.091700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"dc23187e-e9ab-4f65-8def-2c7d5ecffcef","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h usr_41","ts":"1637304211.091600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ffa2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19aebc89-a56f-44c0-84bd-34766fbf23ad","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"困ったらhelp引くといいですね","ts":"1637304209.091400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=jIx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fb06dec-6569-41a7-ad6e-8f17d854a1e8","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"未だにどっちかわからなくなるときがある…","ts":"1637304175.091100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"czr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8ffd13d-db67-4a04-899a-d57543a7b7fc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"スペースありなし...\n• Vim script\n• VimScript\nなんつて","ts":"1637304077.090700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sO3e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f600755e-be7a-4326-895b-c8e5139ebd98","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自分はスペースあり派です！","ts":"1637301683.090200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZY9L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7a0f7ea-a1f8-4e1e-98c9-500531205380","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"PR先に合わせるのは当然として、スペースなし多いなぁ。","ts":"1637255534.089900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZWzJR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dee65cb9-9e02-4484-adc8-25a360613afe","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"自分のソースでは無し派です。\nPR先には合わせます。","ts":"1637253778.089000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bup"}]},{"client_msg_id":"459263c3-cba6-4e1b-bb17-31769d505c9d","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"Lambda も辞書もスペースつけてないです(たまに付いてたりしてていい加減)。理由は lambda のヘルプがそうなってたから。\nただし個人の好みでいいとは思ってます。読みやすいの大切。\n例えば PR した先のコードがスペースあったらスペースつける程度のこだわりです。","ts":"1637248957.088200","edited":{"user":"U78A6ESHM","ts":"1637249133.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nz7CT"}]}]
